  "description": "MyCA module to communicate with PKI services (daemons).\n\n\t\t\tMyCA is a multiplatform (Microsoft Windows, Linux) simple implementation of PKIX\n\t\t\tintended to be used as a simple CA (Certificate Authority).\n\t\t\tIt can also be used to issue trusted timestamps (as Time Stamping Authority (TSA)).\n\t\t\tPKI service (daemon): pkid able to generate X509 certificates\n\t\t\t(and associated private keys)\n\t\t\tand store them in back-end SQL database. It also may act as a OCSP\n\t\t\t(Online Certificate Status Protocol) responder for certificates it issued.",
